            <description><![CDATA[<h2 style="font:600 15px -apple-system;margin:0 0 6px">Promptr Studio Pro 5.76</h2>
<ul style="font:13px -apple-system;margin:0;padding-left:18px">
<li><b>GPT Image 2.5 Sunburst and Flare.</b> OpenAI's new image models join GPT Image 2 in the picker. Sunburst is tuned for editing precision, Flare for fast everyday generation. Both offer the new quality levels xhigh and max.</li>
<li><b>Available soon.</b> The models appear as coming soon until they are switched on in the backend after the first measured runs. No app update is needed for that step.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
