        <item>
            <title>5.74</title>
            <pubDate>Tue, 08 Sep 2026 22:18:09 +0000</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>405</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>5.74</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<h2 style="font:600 15px -apple-system;margin:0 0 6px">Promptr Studio Pro 5.74</h2>
<ul style="font:13px -apple-system;margin:0;padding-left:18px">
<li><b>Clear failure cards.</b> A failed generation now shows what happened, why, and what to do next. Codes and raw provider text stay behind "Details" with a copy button.</li>
<li><b>Seedance 2.5 reference videos up to 30 seconds.</b> Clips are no longer trimmed to 14 seconds, and there is no combined length limit for this model. Seedance 2.0 keeps its 15 second rule.</li>
<li><b>Realistic 3D asset pack.</b> 23 CC0 models ship with the app: building shells, facade modules, a covered car, two body bases and twelve clothed people, ready for the 3D library offline.</li>
<li><b>Camera pan and tilt, obstacle avoidance.</b> Aim the camera with a live preview, and let camera routes avoid static geometry in the routes editor and through 3D Paul.</li>
<li><b>Character rigging prepared.</b> The workflow for rigging your own humanoid GLB is in place and will be enabled with an upcoming backend update.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
